OL,3,GNEWSAHull City charity shares #2m
OL,4,Avision for West Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA #2m redevelopment of sports
OL,7,Ffacilities in Hull's West Park could
OL,8,Fsee outdoor pitches reopen for the
OL,9,Ffirst time since the Covid-19 pandemic.
OL,11,FThe plans, unveiled by the Tigers
OL,12,FTrust, a not-for-profit charity linked
OL,13,Fto Hull City, include refurbishing and
OL,14,Fextending the Tigers Trust Arena,
OL,15,Fbringing the artificial pitches back
OL,16,Finto use and creating a new community
OL,17,Fsports campus.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
