OL,3,GNEWSAHull City charity shares #2m
OL,4,Avision for West Park
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe charity said the scheme would also
OL,7,Fprovide a permanent base for the growth
OL,8,Fof girls' football following its recent
OL,9,Faccreditation as an Emerging Talent
OL,10,FCentre.
OL,12,FChief Executive Karina Ellis said
OL,13,Freopening the pitches would increase
OL,14,Fopportunities for children, young
OL,15,Fpeople and adults to take part in
OL,16,Fsport.
